@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom runtime guidance
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` is asynchronous and requires the custom runtime to supply its canonical instruction loader. The loader must resolve the requested `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md` content; do not substitute an independently maintained instruction.
+
+The returned agent exposes `action: 'classify-for-human-review'` and `canApproveRefunds: false`. Preserve those boundaries when integrating it. This repository establishes no refund-approval or financial-mutation capability.
